OL,3,GNEWSACouncil gives #500k to firm
OL,4,Aseeking local lithium
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #500,000 fund set up following the
OL,7,F2002 closure of a cement works will be
OL,8,Fspent on preparing land for a potential
OL,9,Flithium extraction plant.
OL,11,FIn February 2025 Durham County Council
OL,12,Fgave Weardale Lithium planning
OL,13,Fpermission to build the rare metal
OL,14,Fextraction plant at a former cement
OL,15,Fworks in Eastgate, near Stanhope.
OL,17,FNow a #500,000 council fund set up to
OL,18,Fregenerate the site more than two
OL,19,Fdecades ago has been awarded to the
OL,20,Flithium firm to carry out preparatory
OL,21,Fworks on the empty land.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
